{"id":"d2937bc1068da255","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kucera-slaman.md","title":"Characterization of Random Left-c.e. Reals","display":"thm-kucera-slaman — Characterization of Random Left-c.e. Reals","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kucera-slaman","aliases":["43-thm-kucera-slaman"],"display":"thm-kucera-slaman — Characterization of Random Left-c.e. Reals","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorems 13.3.3–13.3.4 and Corollary 13.3.5","source_printed_pages":"344–345","source_pdf_pages":"364–365","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kucera-slaman"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kucera-slaman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kucera-slaman — Characterization of Random Left-c.e. Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorems 13.3.3–13.3.4 and Corollary 13.3.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"344–345"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"364–365"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\">\\(\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0\">\\(\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a> 的序列谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 量化遍历部分二进制串函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a> 的同名符号。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\land\\alpha=\\Omega_U\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\land\\alpha=\\Omega_U\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>区分两部分归属：随机左 c.e. 实数的 Solovay 完全性是 Kučera–Slaman；完全左 c.e. 实数实现为通用停止概率是 Calude–Hertling–Khoussainov–Wang。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorems 13.3.3–13.3.4 and Corollary 13.3.5；印刷页 344–345，PDF 页 364–365。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}$，且 $\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的序列谓词；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]，$U$ 量化遍历部分二进制串函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}$，且 $\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的序列谓词；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]，$U$ 量化遍历部分二进制串函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]] 的同名符号。 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}$ 采用 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的同名符号。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]] 的同名符号。 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}$ 采用 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的同名符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\land\\alpha=\\Omega_U\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1874,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kucera-slaman]] — Characterization of Random Left-c.e. Reals"}],"outgoing":["2e51855b95e81cff","e7d00f16a112ff92","0586e0fd0301d605","f5078ab697e20add"]}